  <prompt>Convert LegalWorkspace's `src/solutions/LegalWorkspace/src/components/SmartToDo/` into a thin shim that re-exports/consumes `@spaarke/smart-todo-components` (task 002's hoist target) instead of housing the 13-file implementation locally. No duplicated component logic may remain in `src/solutions/LegalWorkspace/src/components/SmartToDo/`. Update the two real LW consumers (`workspaceConfig.tsx` and `App.tsx`) that import `SmartToDo` from `./components/SmartToDo/SmartToDo` so they resolve through the shim/package cleanly. Verify LegalWorkspace builds and the kanban renders identically (visual parity) before and after the swap. Confirm, by grep, that zero `../../../../Spaarke.UI.Components/src/` imports and zero `@spaarke/smart-todo-components`-internal-file reach-ins remain anywhere in the touched packages.</prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Expert in thin-shim conversion patterns for shared-lib consumers and React/TypeScript re-export barrels. Follow ADRs strictly.</role>

  <goal>`src/solutions/LegalWorkspace/src/components/SmartToDo/index.ts` (and any remaining files in that directory) contain ONLY re-exports of `@spaarke/smart-todo-components` symbols — zero duplicated component implementation; `workspaceConfig.tsx` and `App.tsx` render the kanban via the package with no behavioral change; LegalWorkspace builds green; a repo-wide grep confirms zero `../../../../Spaarke.UI.Components/src/` imports and zero direct reach-ins into `Spaarke.SmartTodo.Components/src/` from outside the package.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Spec FR-01 acceptance criterion (c): "LegalWorkspace consumes them via `@spaarke/smart-todo-components` (thin shim only, no duplicated logic)". This mirrors the already-proven Pattern D shim shape used for `SmartTodoWidget` in `src/solutions/LegalWorkspace/src/sections/todo.registration.ts` (host-agnostic shared-lib component; LW-side shim owns only LW-specific coupling). Investigation confirms exactly 2 real consumers import the LW-local rich `SmartToDo` today: `src/solutions/LegalWorkspace/src/workspaceConfig.tsx` (`import { SmartToDo } from "./components/SmartToDo/SmartToDo"`) and `src/solutions/LegalWorkspace/src/App.tsx` (same import, used as `&lt;SmartToDo webApi={webApi} userId={userId} useDialogForDetail /&gt;`). Both must continue to work after the shim conversion, either by importing directly from `@spaarke/smart-todo-components` going forward, or via the thin re-export barrel this task creates at the original `./components/SmartToDo` path (whichever keeps the diff smallest while satisfying "thin shim only, no duplicated logic"). PR #508 is formally closed as superseded at project wrap-up (task 090), NOT by this task — this task only notes it in the acceptance record.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="modify">src/solutions/LegalWorkspace/src/components/SmartToDo/index.ts</file>
      <file role="modify">src/solutions/LegalWorkspace/src/workspaceConfig.tsx</file>
      <file role="modify">src/solutions/LegalWorkspace/src/App.tsx</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/solutions/LegalWorkspace/src/sections/todo.registration.ts</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/client/shared/Spaarke.SmartTodo.Components/src/index.ts</file>
    </relevant-files>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="002" status="pending">Produces the hoisted `@spaarke/smart-todo-components` package surface this shim consumes; MUST be complete before this task starts.</dependency>
    </dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-012">Scope: LegalWorkspace MUST consume the hoisted components via the `@spaarke/smart-todo-components` package specifier only; the shim at `src/solutions/LegalWorkspace/src/components/SmartToDo/` may re-export but must not reimplement any of the 13 hoisted components.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Scope: no behavior change — `workspaceConfig.tsx` and `App.tsx` render identically before/after; delete all now-duplicated logic from `src/solutions/LegalWorkspace/src/components/SmartToDo/` (the 13 files task 002 moved out).</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <topic>thin-shim consumer conversion</topic>
    <files>
      <file>.claude/adr/ADR-012-shared-components.md</file>
      <file>.claude/adr/ADR-021-fluent-design-system.md</file>
      <file>projects/smart-todo-r5/spec.md</file>
