  </outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Given LegalWorkspace builds after the shim conversion, when `npm run build` runs, then it succeeds with zero errors.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given `src/solutions/LegalWorkspace/src/components/SmartToDo/` (if retained) is inspected, then it contains only re-export statements — zero component implementation logic.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given a repo-wide grep for `../../../../Spaarke.UI.Components/src/`, when run after this task, then zero matches remain anywhere in the repo.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given a repo-wide grep for imports of `Spaarke.SmartTodo.Components/src/` from outside that package, when run after this task, then zero matches remain (all consumers use the `@spaarke/smart-todo-components` package specifier).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given `workspaceConfig.tsx` and `App.tsx` render pre- vs. post-shim, then the kanban is visually and behaviorally identical (no regression).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative: if a prop/behavior gap between the LW-local original and the hoisted package version is discovered, the task escalates per CLAUDE.md §6 rather than re-adding local component logic.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>Spec section: FR-01, acceptance criterion (c) + (e). Final step of the Phase 1 serial spine (001→002→003). PR #508 is noted here as ready-to-close but is formally closed as superseded by task 090 (project wrap-up), per CLAUDE.md "Decisions Made" 2026-08-15 entry.

COMPLETION (2026-08-15, sonnet/high, FULL rigor): Discovered a THIRD real consumer beyond the two named in this POML's background — `components/Shell/WorkspaceGrid.tsx`'s `LazySmartToDoDialog` (dynamic import of `../SmartToDo/SmartToDoDialog`), the "Open To Do Dialog" 90vw×90vh Fluent Dialog. Rewired all three (App.tsx, workspaceConfig.tsx via its unchanged import, WorkspaceGrid.tsx via its unchanged import) through a NEW shared hook `src/solutions/LegalWorkspace/src/hooks/useSmartToDoBridge.ts` that fulfils the full task-002 injected-props contract once (items/isLoading/error/onRefetch, preferences/onUpdatePreferences/prefsLoading, onCreateTodo/onDismissTodo/onRestoreTodo→ITodoMutationResult, dataverseService (LW's DataverseService passed directly — structurally compatible with IKanbanDataverseService, no adapter class needed), feedSync (useFeedTodoSync bridge), onOpenTodo (Xrm.Navigation webresource nav, ported verbatim from the pre-hoist handleOpenSmartTodo)). `components/SmartToDo/SmartToDo.tsx` and `SmartToDoDialog.tsx` became thin shims (preserve the pre-hoist public prop surface so workspaceConfig.tsx/WorkspaceGrid.tsx needed ZERO changes) calling the bridge hook and forwarding to the package components. `index.ts` is now a 2-export barrel. Deleted (git rm) the other 10 fully-duplicated files. Also fixed a pre-existing tsc error in App.tsx: a dead `useDialogForDetail` JSX prop that was never part of ISmartToDoProps in either the old or new component (confirmed via baseline tsc diff — 8 fewer errors post-change, zero new ones). `npm run build` fails on an unrelated pre-existing `@tiptap/core` resolution error in `Spaarke.Compose.Components` (confirmed identical on baseline via git-stash A/B test) — out of scope for this task. Full detail: `projects/smart-todo-r5/notes/task-003-shim.md`.</notes>

